tions in 1999. The carrier's primary business focus was flights within southern Florida and to the Bahamas. Airways International also operated charter flights. In 1985, Airways began service to the Bahamas with Convair 580 aircraft. Throughout its history, Airways operated a fleet of Shorts 330, Convair 580, Cessna 402, Convair 440, and Piper Aztec aircraft. In 1992, the airline added the Shorts 330 to its fleet and operated. As of 1992, there were 30 aircraft\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0037-56a67f50579e:d01\", \"text\": \"Airways International was an airline based in Anchorage, Alaska. Airways International was founded in 1979 and began operations around 1984. The airline ceased operations in 1999. The carrier's primary business focus was flights within southern Florida and to the Bahamas. Airways International also operated charter flights. In 1985, Airways began service to the Bahamas with Convair 580 aircraft. Throughout its history, Airways operated a fleet of Shorts 330, Convair 580, Cessna 402, Convair 440, and Piper Aztec aircraft. In 1992, the airline added the Shorts 330 to its fleet and operated. As of 1992, there were 30 aircraft.\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0037-56a67f50579e:d02\", \"text\": \"on its own airlines , along with hotel rooms , from brick-and-mortar stores meant it had been struggling to compete with online rivals and low-budget upstarts . Uncertainty over Brexit and a weak pound were also cited as contributor factors to the operator ’ s struggles . The airline section of the business operated with more than 100 aircraft , based in the UK , Denmark and Germany . Wow Air Wow Air had hoped that a last-minute sale or merger with a higher-profile airline would come through . Getty Images/studioportosabbia In March 2019 , Iceland-based Wow Air , known\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0037-56a67f50579e:d03\", \"text\": \"Privacy Policy . Wikipedia® is a registered trademark of the Wikimedia Foundation , Inc. , a non-profit organization . Privacy policy 